url: 'https://github.com/dronefreak/clearview'
abstract: >-
  ClearView is a PyTorch framework for single-image deraining. It provides
  U-Net, Attention U-Net, ResNet-UNet, NAFNet, Restormer and Histoformer
  architectures, a library of pixel, structural, edge, frequency and
  perceptual losses, full-reference and no-reference evaluation metrics,
  and a mixed-domain training recipe that blends synthetic and real-world
  rain datasets. Trained checkpoints for the model zoo are published on
  the Hugging Face Hub.
